            "review_title": "Review at I'm Salad",
            "review_text": "Kenneth Wu\nNew York City, New York15 contributions\n1\nThe best health food restaurant! And it's delicious too\nMay 2024 • Couples\nThe restaurant is a 15-minute walk from my stay at the Park Hyatt Hotel, and I've been there for three days in a row. It serves healthy and delicious meals. The staff are friendly, and even as closing time approaches, the ingredients remain fresh. Given my strict dietary requirements—no salt, extremely low saturated fats—I'm confident that the dishes are made on-site. There's usually a short wait for the food to be served. However, during the day, the interior is filled with ample natural light, and outside, the view is lush and green. Even without air conditioning, it's not too warm. Who minds spending a little extra time sitting in this beautiful restaurant? I hope to encounter it not just in Ho Chi Minh City but also near my home.\nRead more\nWritten May 17, 2024",
