            "review_title": "Review at I'm Salad",
            "review_text": "Jet R\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat Food and Service\nMay 2024 • Friends\nThe salad selection are superb! I am lost for words how cheap the price is considering the service and the food is top notch. We may have struggled finding this place but it is all worth the it. Steak was perfectly cooked and seasoned same with the egg salad. We genuinely enjoyed the food. The juice were all refreshing and healthy. This place is highly recommended for travelers and foreigners alike. Value for the buck!!!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nAsk locals for the place. It's quite tricky to get there.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 10, 2024",
